Page.mouse.move

Move the mouse to CSS-pixel coordinates. Options: steps: Number of movement steps. label: Concise user-visible action description shown with the native mouse highlight.

await page.mouse.move(x, y, { steps?, label? })
Page.mouse.down

Press a mouse button at the current Page position. Options: button (left | middle | right): Mouse button. clickCount: Click count reported to the page.

await page.mouse.down({ button?, clickCount? })
Page.mouse.up

Release a mouse button at the current Page position. Options: button (left | middle | right): Mouse button. clickCount: Click count reported to the page.

await page.mouse.up({ button?, clickCount? })
Page.mouse.wheel

Perform a short wheel-input motion at the current Page position; move or click over the intended scroll container first in each process. Options: label: Concise user-visible action description shown with the native mouse highlight.

await page.mouse.wheel(deltaX, deltaY, { label? })
